      "writtenOn": "2021-03-30T10:03:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With Zephyr\u0027s log, the debug messages contains the prefix (module_name + function name) which make the message hard to read. Here is the example:\n[00:00:16.233,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.cros_shi_npcx_isr: CSNFE-\n[00:00:16.233,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.shi_handle_cs_assert: CSL-\n[00:00:16.233,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.cros_shi_npcx_isr: HDR-\n[00:00:16.233,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.shi_parse_header: RV-\n[00:00:16.233,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.shi_handle_host_package: PRC-\n[00:00:16.234,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.shi_send_response_packet: SND-\n[00:00:16.234,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.cros_shi_npcx_isr: CSH-\n[00:00:16.234,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.cros_shi_npcx_reset_prepare: RDY-\n[00:00:16.234,000] \u003cdbg\u003e cros_shi.shi_handle_cs_deassert: END\n\nI\u0027d want to have the message look like this:\nCSNFE-CSL-HDR-RV-PRC-[4.585300 HC 0x102]                                                                                                                                                                                                      \nSND-CSH-RDY-END",
      "parentUuid": "7c36c52d_a4dd256d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 6
      },
